From: JohanR7 <143104864+JohanR7@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:03:50 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] CH01: crop profiles for the bang-bang irrigation
 controller

Add mycodo/utils/crop_profiles.py (CropProfile value type, one
registration point and one lookup point; tomato, rice, wheat) and a
'crop_profile' option on the bang-bang Function. A selected crop
supplies the setpoint (target soil moisture) and hysteresis
(tolerance); 'custom' (default) keeps the configured values. Unknown
crops are logged and ignored. Tests for AC1-AC7.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
